WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:03.920
Great inventions deserve a clear path.
Here’s yours.

00:04.150 --> 00:09.820
Sign up, review our signed confidentiality
undertaking, then upload your materials to
a private case.

00:10.050 --> 00:16.020
Book a consultation. Unlock the prior art
report and select the invention you want to
pursue.

00:16.250 --> 00:21.120
If accepted, review your quote, sign the
agreement, and enter your filing details.

00:21.350 --> 00:28.220
Review and approve Word drafts. Settle the
filing invoice and authorize the exact
package with an email code.

00:28.450 --> 00:34.420
After ePCT filing, download your official
receipt. Then the international searching
authority takes over.

00:34.650 --> 00:40.020
See whose turn it is. Team updates have a
target. Official processing runs
separately.

00:40.250 --> 00:44.920
Get the publication notice and settle the
balance. ResearchVault Patent.
